00:55:38.170 --> 00:55:56.830
<v Ira Glass>Thanks this week to Life Partner Cici Chen Mengfei and Colette Spriggins. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He's been taking a figure drawing class. His drawings are pretty good, except for the hands. He does the shoulder, upper arm, forearm all great. And then gets to the end of the arm, and it's always--
<v Ira Glass>感谢本周的合作伙伴 Cici Chen Mengfei 和 Colette Spriggins。像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人托雷·马拉蒂亚先生。他一直在上素描课。他的画相当不错，除了手。他把肩膀、上臂、前臂都画得很好。然后到了手臂末端，总是……

00:55:56.830 --> 00:55:59.040
<v Armando Iannucci>We can't quite put a finger on it.
<v Armando Iannucci>我们说不出哪里不对。

00:55:59.040 --> 00:56:04.040
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
